        "exact_excerpt": "  The  corsairs  not  only  scoured  the  sea,  but \noften  raided  the  coasts  of  Italy,  Spain,  and  the  various \nMediterranean  islands,  sometimes  advancing  consider- \nable distances  inland,  robbing  houses  and  villages  and \ncarrying  off  the  inhabitants  into  slavery.",
        "attribution": "stated"
      },
      "historically_verified": false
    },
